        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:variety#e-0a97e50fff671adc",
          "text": "Depending on the plant variety and location, a single tree can take 5 to 10 hours to complete, while larger projects may take 20 to 30 hours and need to be maintained two or three times a year.",
