        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:variety#e-1e76ea133e4e4bd1",
          "text": "From over 3,000 rice varieties, the team identified a naturally stronger version of the gene and used traditional plant breeding (育种) to cross it into varieties carrying a weaker form.",
